    "permission": "Seymour Duncan encourages sharing wiring diagrams freely; commercial use needs prior written permission. LIMITATIONS: Generic humbuckers use logical terminals, not lead colors/polarity. Bridge ground, cable, load omitted; no bridge terminal. Two blade poles model 3-way toggle logic, not physical terminals. Logical pot lugs and linear scale, not audio taper. Two volumes exceed the one-master-volume limit; estimate unavailable. Only bridge push/pull splits; neck stays in series."
  },
